{"symbol":"HMS.ST","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-16T18:24:46Z","info":{"address1":"Stationsgatan 37","city":"Halmstad","zip":"302 50","country":"Sweden","phone":"46 35 17 29 00","website":"https://www.hms-networks.com","industry":"Communication Equipment","industryKey":"communication-equipment","industryDisp":"Communication Equipment","sector":"Technology","sectorKey":"technology","sectorDisp":"Technology","longBusinessSummary":"HMS Networks AB (publ) provides industrial information and communication technology solutions worldwide. The company offers industrial data products, including HMI and panel meters, industrial controllers, network diagnostics, network security, and remote gateway products; industrial network connectivity products comprising embedded network interfaces, functional safety, gateways and protocol converters, industrial PC interfaces, industrial wireless, and switches and infrastructure products; building automation gateway products that include AC cloud control, AC, AW heat pump, and protocol converter gateways; vehicle and medical communication products, such as computing gateways, infrastructure components, and PC interfaces; and related software, tools, and accessories. Its products are used for battery energy storage, EV charging, factory to building, HVAC control, lighting control, mobile robots, PLCs, robot controllers, and smart metering applications. The company also provides building control and connectivity; CAN connectivity, access, and diagnostics; functional safety; industrial network connectivity, diagnostics, infrastructure, and security; industrial remote access; machine visualization/control; and vehicle network connectivity solutions. It sells its products under the Anybus, Ixxat, Ewon, Intesis, Red Lion, and N-Tron brands. The company serves automotive, building and factory automation, food and beverage, medical, packaging, power generation, process automation, transport and infrastructure, warehouse and distribution, and water/wastewater industries. HMS Networks AB (publ) was founded in 1988 and is headquartered in Halmstad, Sweden.","fullTimeEmployees":1137,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Staffan  Dahlstrom","age":58,"title":"Co-Founder, CEO & President","yearBorn":1967,"fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":10311000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Joakim  Nideborn","age":42,"title":"CFO & Deputy CEO","yearBorn":1983,"fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Richard  Skog","age":56,"title":"Chief Operating Officer","yearBorn":1969,"fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mira Jhaveri Winther","age":51,"title":"Chief Human Resource Officer","yearBorn":1974,"fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Alexander  Hess","age":44,"title":"Senior Vice President Industrial Data Solutions","yearBorn":1981,"fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Bartek Stelmasiak Candell","age":45,"title":"Senior Vice President Industrial Network Technology","yearBorn":1980,"fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"auditRisk":2,"boardRisk":6,"compensationRisk":1,"shareHolderRightsRisk":4,"overallRisk":3,"governanceEpochDate":1793491200,"compensationAsOfEpochDate":1767139200,"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":2,"previousClose":472.6,"open":469.2,"dayLow":468.4,"dayHigh":478,"regularMarketPreviousClose":472.6,"regularMarketOpen":469.2,"regularMarketDayLow":468.4,"regularMarketDayHigh":478,"dividendRate":4.8,"dividendYield":1.02,"exDividendDate":1776988800,"payoutRatio":0.4356,"fiveYearAvgDividendYield":0.81,"beta":1.143,"trailingPE":42.7066,"forwardPE":39.8813,"volume":29795,"regularMarketVolume":29795,"averageVolume":54583,"averageVolume10days":46175,"averageDailyVolume10Day":46175,"bid":471.6,"ask":472.4,"bidSize":0,"askSize":0,"marketCap":23601227776,"nonDilutedMarketCap":23721691961,"fift